  "validation": "Paired eight-module DAG builds through Halt with direct-input hashes; 67 target-namespace type and axiom reports match, including generated auxiliaries. Independent review validates all branch tuples and unchanged bounds; forced equations match; global simp and instance censuses match.",
  "limitations": [
    "Upstream project and Foundation objects remained precompiled; direct import hashes do not establish a fresh full transitive closure.",
    "Target census covers the target namespace; forcing equations also reveals two private helpers and 22 new private matcher declarations. Global attribute-kind census does not enumerate all individual attribute applications or arbitrary persistent extensions.",
    "Initial failed Foundation setup log was overwritten and is represented by a reconstructed transcript; it is not counted as validation. The superseded v1 probe record is not fully self-contained, but its unrestricted reports are retained.",
    "Archives omit compiled objects and depend on original paths and toolchain for replay."
  ],
